        <h2>Best Practices for Scanning Signatures and Photographs</h2>
        <p>
          To ensure your photographs and signatures pass strict automated validation checks run by recruiting boards and passport authorities:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Signature Backgrounds:</strong> Always sign on clean, bright white unruled paper using an ink pen with deep black or navy blue ink. Avoid textured surfaces, shadows, or faint ballpoint pens.</li>
          <li><strong>Even Lighting on Portraits:</strong> Stand facing a window or direct, even light source. Uneven lighting cast across one side of the face causes automated facial recognition engines to reject candidate images.</li>
          <li><strong>Avoid Premature Cropping:</strong> Keep adequate whitespace around your shoulders and hair. It is easier to downscale an image with healthy borders than it is to stretch an excessively tight crop without causing distortion.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Why Choose ConvertKB Over Cloud Compressors?</h2>
        <p>
          Traditional utility tools require uploading documents to remote cloud storage servers, which poses severe privacy and security risks when handling confidential identification documents (e.g., Aadhaar cards, PAN cards, Passports, SSNs, or Bank Statements). ConvertKB executes compression algorithms locally within your device's browser memory sandbox, guaranteeing complete document privacy, zero server storage delays, and unlimited file processing without daily usage throttles.
